fe Museum","type":"LinguisticObject"},{"classified_as":[{"_label":"Caption - Artist(s)","id":"https://data.okeeffemuseum.org/terms/caption_artist"}],"content":"Georgia O'Keeffe","type":"LinguisticObject"},{"classified_as":[{"_label":"Caption - Copyright","id":"https://data.okeeffemuseum.org/terms/caption_copyright"}],"content":"© Georgia O'Keeffe Museum","type":"LinguisticObject"},{"classified_as":[{"_label":"Materials description","id":"https://data.okeeffemuseum.org/terms/materials_description"}],"content":"Oil on canvas","type":"LinguisticObject"},{"classified_as":[{"_label":"Measurement Description","id":"https://data.okeeffemuseum.org/terms/measurement_description"}],"content":"30 x 18 inches","type":"LinguisticObject"},{"classified_as":[{"_label":"Caption - Medium and Dimensions","id":"https://data.okeeffemuseum.org/terms/caption_medium_dims"}],"content":"Oil on canvas, 30 x 18 inches","type":"LinguisticObject"},{"classified_as":[{"_label":"provenance_narrative","id":"https://data.okeeffemuseum.org/terms/local/provenance_narrative"}],"content":"[1] By March 29, 1955, (The Downtown Gallery, New York, New York, USA; [2] November 1, 1956, purchased by Allen-Bradley Co. (Milwaukee, Wisconsin, USA); [3] June 1969, gift to The Bradley Family Foundation (Milwaukee, Wisconsin, USA); 1977, gift to Milwaukee Art Center (Milwaukee, Wisconsin, USA) \nNOTES: \n[1] Downtown Gallery, O’Keeffe Exhibition: New Paintings (New York: The Downtown Gallery, 1955), cat. 17. (as Black Door with Snow) \n[2] Invoice addressed to The Allen Bradley Company in MAM object file, with note that it was retained from on approval. See also Barbara Buhler Lynes, Georgia O'Keeffe: Catalogue Raisonne. Vol 2 (New Haven, CT: Yale University Press, 1999), p. 809, cat. 1284. \n[3] Documentation from The Bradley Family Foundation in MAM object file. See also Barbara Buhler Lynes, Georgia O'Keeffe: Catalogue Raisonne. Vol 2 (New Haven, CT: Yale University Press, 1999), p. 809, cat. 1284. \n(Source: MAM, 2025)","type":"LinguisticObject"},{"classified_as":[{"_label":"Caption - Title and Date","id":"https://data.okeeffemuseum.org/terms/caption_title_date"}],"content":"Black Door with Snow II, 1955","type":"LinguisticObject"},{"classified_as":[{"_label":"cr_remarks_1999","id":"https://data.okeeffemuseum.org/terms/local/cr_remarks_1999"}],"content":["Titled *Black Door with Snow* by O'Keeffe on Abiquiú Notebooks photograph. (Source: Lynes, 1999)"],"type":"LinguisticObject"},{"classified_as":[{"_label":"Caption - Holding Institution","id":"https://data.okeeffemuseum.org/terms/caption_instituion"}],"content":"Milwaukee Art Museum","type":"LinguisticObject"}],"representation":[{"digitally_shown_by":[{"access_point":[{"id":"https://iiif.okeeffemuseum.org/image/iiif/2/862538/full/full/0/default.jpg","type":"DigitalObject"}],"classified_as":[{"_label":"Digital Image","id":"http://vocab.getty.edu/aat/300215302","type":"Type"}],"digitally_available_via":[{"access_point":[{"id":"https://iiif.okeeffemuseum.org/image/iiif/2/862538"}],"conforms_to":[{"id":"http://iiif.io/api/image","type":"InformationObject"}],"format":"application/ld+json;profile='http://iiif.io/api/image/2/context.json'","type":"DigitalService"}],"type":"DigitalObject"}],"type":"VisualItem"}],"type":"HumanMadeObject"}